                "entry_id": "86ae5804-044f-3d21-af75-80a179712a16",
                "word": "Walmart",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "08f55549-b627-4d57-9e9c-6dd32aad9cbf",
                        "entry_id": "86ae5804-044f-3d21-af75-80a179712a16",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "Walmarts"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "377b1bf9-51c6-3d0e-9e4e-5f161a5fa2ac",
                        "entry_id": "86ae5804-044f-3d21-af75-80a179712a16",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A chain of large, discount department stores (most of which also sell groceries), originating in the United States and later spreading to several other countries."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d29787ef-84fc-4f85-bac9-ef99181fc1d1",
                                "sense_id": "377b1bf9-51c6-3d0e-9e4e-5f161a5fa2ac",
                                "text": "It’s pretty obvious if you are a coffee drinker that Starbucks ain’t the Walmart of coffee."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "baa1a89a-1499-4645-8c2a-cb4a5b6da071",
                                "sense_id": "377b1bf9-51c6-3d0e-9e4e-5f161a5fa2ac",
                                "text": "In the 1990s, Barnes & Noble opened superstore after superstore across the United States. It become the Walmart of books, with the same attitude toward vendors."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "93f483cb-083a-408e-89e5-af35d3fed4a0",
                                "sense_id": "377b1bf9-51c6-3d0e-9e4e-5f161a5fa2ac",
                                "text": "Step into a Castle Megastore, and it’s clear they aim to be like a big box equivalent to a traditional sex shop — the Walmart of wang, if you will — no identity-concealing trench coat required."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "bde0e86f-1c4f-3561-9de8-ef33c8ad5c83",
