                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b6fc1ea5-ba97-3362-b95d-492a5b16916c",
                        "entry_id": "bde0e86f-1c4f-3561-9de8-ef33c8ad5c83",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To shop at Walmart."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "intransitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "032011d7-f393-4ab7-8726-b98f96d0edb6",
                                "sense_id": "b6fc1ea5-ba97-3362-b95d-492a5b16916c",
                                "text": "Next we went Walmarting, where Shanti picked up more stuff for college, like sports bras in purple, white, and black and a hot water heater for dormitory tea parties."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4ada9ec1-4780-42f4-b4cd-4e9e395ef5ca",
                                "sense_id": "b6fc1ea5-ba97-3362-b95d-492a5b16916c",
                                "text": "You’ll need to choose a day and time slot for pickup — who would have thought we’d ever miss Walmarting on a whim? — so make sure you plan ahead."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "21a3cd29-bbb9-4525-9062-d51492655bc0",
                                "sense_id": "b6fc1ea5-ba97-3362-b95d-492a5b16916c",
                                "text": "She and her best friend Earlene Pebworth, spent many happy days playing cards cards and bingo, as well as making the famous Christmas candy, gossiping, Walmarting and entertaining the Manor staff and residents with their antics."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8451dad0-b1d4-3a2c-9bdb-7c776c1175b4",
                        "entry_id": "bde0e86f-1c4f-3561-9de8-ef33c8ad5c83",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To outcompete, or drive out of business, by one's superior size and market share."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1b95c5c8-c866-4d66-8c01-371fd8fdba51",
                                "sense_id": "8451dad0-b1d4-3a2c-9bdb-7c776c1175b4",
                                "text": "Small farms make it difficult for the flu to spread, unlike in America where poultry majors have Walmarted individual farmers out of business."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d55129f1-012e-4ee3-a2af-2cce45c2b72e",
                                "sense_id": "8451dad0-b1d4-3a2c-9bdb-7c776c1175b4",
                                "text": "He wasn’t thinking, wasn’t competing. Walmarted into obscurity."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b23e23db-ad9e-42f1-be09-750e86922e09",
                                "sense_id": "8451dad0-b1d4-3a2c-9bdb-7c776c1175b4",
                                "text": "“Nature is taking care of itself. They wiped out so many mom-and-pop independent bookstores,” he [John King] said. “They Walmarted the cities and towns, and now they’re getting what they deserve. I hate to be that forward, but that’s the way I feel.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "76f6ccb7-403e-4885-b668-4b7b69ac3f9c",
                                "sense_id": "8451dad0-b1d4-3a2c-9bdb-7c776c1175b4",
                                "text": "\"Basically I've been Walmarted out of the business.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b35eaac-9399-4fb6-b616-09774c43a9b0",
                                "sense_id": "8451dad0-b1d4-3a2c-9bdb-7c776c1175b4",
                                "text": "Norwegian is recruiting U.S. flight crews, and the giant lines have already Walmarted much of their offshore maintenance, reservations services, and such."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4ff7948e-8c1b-4e8b-bd74-16c21d0f16de",
                                "sense_id": "8451dad0-b1d4-3a2c-9bdb-7c776c1175b4",
                                "text": "How liberating might this notion be today if the playing field weren’t Walmarted with too-big-to-fail megacorporations and oligopolies."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dd38a480-2fc5-4616-9229-34adb5309b53",
                                "sense_id": "8451dad0-b1d4-3a2c-9bdb-7c776c1175b4",
                                "text": "A piece of backstory that got nixed from the final “I Care a Lot” script explained that Marla actually owned a boutique vape store and was “Walmarted out of business,” leading her to “play dirty like everybody else,” [Rosamund] Pike says."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
